ef='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/you-can-no-longer-think-of-yourselves.html?showComment=1308591471975#c4415655487305448561' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/you-can-no-longer-think-of-yourselves.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6317587879710107532' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6317587879710107532' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1687100672"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 20, 2011 at 11:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9214204729007825951</id><published>2011-06-20T06:03:55.176-06:00</published><updated>2011-06-20T06:03:55.176-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Why don&amp;#39;t these psycho cops just join the Army...</title><content type='html'>Why don&amp;#39;t these psycho cops just join the Army and go to Afghanistan?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Or, why don&amp;#39;t they join Blackwater?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I HAVE THE ANSWER:  They are pussies who like willing victims.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;These pussies like a badge on their chests that &amp;#39;say&amp;#39; that you can&amp;#39;t shoot back.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pussies.  What else can you call it?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6317587879710107532/comments/default/9214204729007825951'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6317587879710107532/comments/default/9214204729007825951'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/you-can-no-longer-think-of-yourselves.html?showComment=13085714351